            <ArticleTitle>Trapdoor spiders of the genus Cyclocosmia Ausserer, 1871 from China and Vietnam (Araneae, Ctenizidae).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>75-85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3897/zookeys.643.10797</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A species of the genus Cyclocosmia Ausserer, 1871 collected from Guizhou Province, China is diagnosed and described as new to science: Cyclocosmia liui Xu, Xu &amp; Li, sp. n. (♀). New records of Cyclocosmia latusicosta Zhu, Zhang &amp; Zhang, 2006 (♀) from China (Yunnan Province) and Vietnam (Vinh Phuc Province, Ninh Binh Province), and Cyclocosmia ricketti (Pocock, 1901) collected from Jiangxi Province, China are also reported in this study.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
